:: T: VehVeh Crafting [topic] {"position":"7025,1650","size":"100,100"}
{=

(storylet: when
(passage:) contains "NPC"
and $char's VehVeh's opinion's 2nd > 20
and $char's VehVeh's location is "Apesai Lighthouse"
and $char's player's timerCooldown does not contain "T: VehVeh Crafting"
)
(urgency: .5)
(metadata:
"NPC", "VehVeh",
"title", "Asking Veh-Veh About School Facilities",
"topic", [{
     (if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's att, "accessLighthouseStudentLab", 0) < 1)[
          "How would a magus go about doing synthesis here in Apesai? Where are the magic workstations?"
     ]
     (else:)["Can you tell me about the school's synthesis lab again?"]
}],
"topicDetail", "A magus without a synthesis lab is like a sculptor without a chisel.",
"cooldown", 1,
"talked", (a: "studentLab", "library", "absentPrincipal",),
"addCode", [],
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: VehVeh")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s topicDetail)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

<!--initialize: already have access? sickTeacher?-->
(set: _alreadystudentLab to false)
(set: _alreadyLibrary to false)
(set: _sickTeacher to false)
(set: _sickTeacherMentioned to false)

(if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's att, "accessLighthouseStudentLab", 0) > 0)[
          (set: _alreadystudentLab to true)
]

(if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's att, "accessLighthouseLibrary", 0) > 0)[
     (set: _alreadyLibrary to true)
]

(if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's quests, "sickTeacher", "") is "active")[
     (set: _sickTeacher to true)
]

(if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "sickTeacher") >= 1)[(set: _sickTeacherMentioned to true)]


$cssDesc[''You: //(print: (passage:)'s topic)//'']
<br>

<!--not have access yet sequence-->
(if: _alreadystudentLab is false)[
["Right here, in the tower,"]<VehVehLine| she points vaguely at the lighthouse's midsection. ["Our school has a several synthesis arrays and elementalysis tables up on the fifth floor laboratory. Not the most sophisticated setup, but the staff do their best to ensure that the apprentices always have something to learn with. No education like the hands-on kind."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She means the classroom models. For children.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Does the school have something more... professional?\"", "somethingMoreAdvanced",
     "<!--B-->\"Alright, no problem. I think can work with that.\"", "canIUseIt",
))
<br>


<!--somethingMoreAdvanced-->
[
["O- oh, you mean our research facilities?"]<VehVehLine| She suddenly sounds hesitant. ["Of course, silly me. I get so used to talking to prospective families. Yes, we do have research-grade equipment. And by 'we', I mean our principal does, in his office, but apprentices aren't allowed in."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
The principal would be the best-equipped scholar. That's the case in any school. But it is disappointing, and a little bit odd, that there is nothing in the middle for the young but serious magi.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Can I talk to your principal? He'd be accomodating towards visiting colleagues.\"", "talkToPrincipal",
     "<!--B-->\"Alright, no problem. I can settle for the students' lab.\"", "canIUseIt",
))
<br>
](somethingMoreAdvanced|


<!--talkToPrincipal-->
[
["Erm... thing is, he's not here. Not at the moment,"]<VehVehLine| she crosses her arms. It seems that she has been trying not to broach that subject. ["For what it's worth, I hear the teachers say that once we get more funding from the governor, we can have fancier labs installed. Though we might have to rent a building across the street; the tower's already out of empty floors..."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Veh-Veh is going off on a tangent again.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--B-->\"Alright, no problem. I can settle for the students lab.\"", "canIUseIt",
))
<br>
](talkToPrincipal|


<!--canIUseIt-->
[
["Oh. OH! You want to //use// the lab. My mistake, I thought you were just asking - you know, out of curiosity,"]<VehVehLine| she fiddles with her clothes. ["What for, if you don't mind me asking?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>

<!--variable choices-->
(set: _responsesWhatFor to (dm:
     "<!--B-->\"Alchemy, of course.\"", "alchemyOfCourse",
     "<!--C-->\"Ha, a magus without a synthesis lab is like a sculptor without a chisel. It's better to know there's one wherever one goes.\"", "justBecause",
))
<!--add option if sickTeacher-->
(if: _sickTeacher)[(set: _responsesWhatFor to it + (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"I'm traveling with my teacher, and he's not feeling well.\"", "sickTeacher1",
))]

($funcInnerConvo: _responsesWhatFor)
<br>
](canIUseIt|

<!--alchemyOfCourse-->
[
["Duh, where is my head? Sorry, I wasn't expecting- It's just that visiting magi don't usually care for basic labs. They're all //imperial artificers// and //military alchemists//. You know, the picky type. They never stay for long."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
You, too, are bound elsewhere, as soon as you can find a way to get off this rock.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"So... who do I talk to to get into the student lab?\"", "canUseLab",
))
<br>
](alchemyOfCourse|

<!--justBecause-->
[
Not to mention it will save quite a bit of money in the long run if one is self-sufficient, especially when one makes use of others' facilities. Yes, best not to mention that last part.
<br>
["Ooh, what a line! Let me write that down. I'll definitely be saying something like that once I start //my// journey,"]<VehVehLine| she chuckles, and she actually takes out a pocket note and reed pen, though you wouldn't know if she's instead writing that today, she met an entitled blowhard.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"So... who do I talk to to get into the student lab?\"", "canUseLab",
))
<br>
](justBecause|


<!--canUseLab-->
[
["Me. I'll signal for the attendants to stand down. Just head up the tower, fifth floor. Can't miss the door with the big safety poster,]<VehVehLine| she motions with her hands what a door and a poster might look like, a habit you see in a few of your teachers.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Just like that?\"", "justLikeThat",
     "<!--B-->\"You sure get to decide a lot for an assistant.\" And an ungraduated one at that.", "justLikeThat",
))
<br>
](canUseLab|

<!--justLikeThat-->
[
["Yeah, normally, we don't let just anyone use our alchemical equipment, but you're not just //anyone//, right? So I don't see any harm in it. Plus, it's not like the children are using the machines to their full capacity anyhow. If the principal disagrees... well, he shouldn't have left me with so much responsibility. He'll get to reprimand me all he wants whenever he gets back."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Thank you, Veh-Veh. Anything I need to know about the lab? Specifications? Quirks? Where the ingredient inventory is?\"", "anythingNeedToKnow",
))
<br>
](justLikeThat|

<!--anythingNeedToKnow-->
[
["Ingredients? Oof, that's where I'll have to disappoint. The coffer upstairs is locked, and the remaining teachers are down to buying individual roots at Grand Exchange prices with their own money. You'll have to do likewise."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She seems to truly regret asking you to pay for your own ingredients.
<br>
["In any case, you're unlikely to run a production-sized batch here. With most classes still going, there's only ever two free arrays, max. And, they're fairly fuel-efficient. It won't bankrupt you, is what I'm trying to say."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Perhaps not you, but the school seems to be going through austere times.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"What about formula books? Just in case I need a reminder.\"", "formulaBooks",
))
<br>
](anythingNeedToKnow|

<!--formulaBooks-->
[
You haven't //forgotten// your formulas - is what you're hoping she gets.
<br>
["We have a library a floor above the lab. It's not the whole library, since the rest is upstairs, locked... I'm just repeating myself, aren't I? You get the gist of it. You won't find tomes on secret metaphysics or taxonomies of heresies or anything, but the basics are all there. Good enough for our junior apprentices."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
It's hard to imagine how older students like Veh-Veh are keeping themselves intellectually satiated in this veritable //desert//, to say nothing of the teachers.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Very well. Lab's on fifth floor; library's on sixth. I think I can find my way from here.\"", "gainAccess",
))
<br>
](formulaBooks|

<!--gainAccess-->
[
["Good, good. And the attendants - let me just..."]<VehVehLine| she holds up an amulet and whispers an incantation. Its colors shift. ["There you go. Up the stairs and walk straight in."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
$cssDesc[You can now access the ''student lab'' - a tentative place for you to work your magic - and ''library'' - where many useful books can be found - at the Apesai Lighthouse.]
<br>
["Oh, and one last thing: Since I couldn't help out more,"]<VehVehLine| she pulls from her coat pocket a small gut skin bag, the content inside glowing a faint red. ["Take my leftover vehzin. It's not a lot, but the student lab doesn't need much fuel either. Should be enough for a full synthesis cycle."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
$cssDesc[You also receive a ''(print: (passage: "item.vehzin")'s id)'' - standard fuel for many magical machineries.]
<br>
---
(link: "\"This is a lot already. Gratitude, Veh-Veh.\"")[{
     
     <!--registers all "talked" keys-->
     ($funcTalked:)
     <!--put the crafting topic on cooldown-->
     ($funcAddStoryletCooldown: (passage:)'s name)

     <!--receive vehzin-->
     ($funcGainLoss: "item.", "vehzin", 1)

     <!--gain acces to lab-->
     (if: _alreadystudentLab is false)[
          ($funcGainLoss: "att.", "accessLighthouseStudentLab", 1)
     ]

     <!--gain access to library-->
     (if: _alreadyLibrary is false)[
          ($funcGainLoss: "att.", "accessLighthouseLibrary", 1)
     ]
     (goto: "VehVeh Crafting (End)")
}]
](gainAccess|


<!--sickTeacher1-->
[
     <!--put the crafting topic on cooldown-->
     ($funcAddStoryletCooldown: (passage:)'s name)
     <!--goto-->
     (goto: "T: VehVeh Fluxy Teacher")
](sickTeacher1|

]<!--end of not have access yet sequence-->


<!--already have access (either via the "crafting" or the "sickTeacher" topic)-->
(else:)[
["(either: "Sure, no problem.","Oh, did you forget?","You mean the student lab?", "You sure can.") It's on the fifth floor, up the spiral stairs. There //should// be a few free synthesis arrays. The elementalysis table is in the same room, too. (either: "Hope the attendants aren't giving you any trouble. They're sore due for repairs.", "It's not much, but it //is// the 'full package'. In a way.", "It's not the fastest, but it used to take a whole week to run a cycle.", "I just had everything re-tuned a couple of weeks back. No, more like a month.")"]<VehVehLine|

<!--convo works a bit different because questions can be asked in any order.-->
(set: $stuff to (dm:))
(set: $stuff to it + (dm: "number", 1))
(set: $stuff to it + (dm: "againChoices", (dm:
     "<!--A--><!--againLibrary-->\"And if I need to go over some formulas, where should I look?\"", "againLibrary" + (str: $stuff's number),
     "<!--B--><!--againIngredients-->\"What about ingredients for elementalysis? Where might I find some?\"", "againIngredients" + (str: $stuff's number),
     "<!--C--><!--againFuel-->\"Let's say I want to cook up more than a few batches, where do I get the fuel for that?\"", "againFuel" + (str: $stuff's number),
     "<!--D-->\"That's it for the labs for now. Thank you.\"", "againThanks",
)))

<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's againChoices)
<br>

(set: _editChoices to (macro: str-type _deleteWhich, [(out:)[{
     <!--advance 1 number-->
     (set: $stuff's number to it + 1)
     <!--edit destination number-->
     (for: each _question, ...(datanames: $stuff's againChoices))[
          <!--edit-->
          (unless: $stuff's againChoices's _question contains "Thanks")[
               (set: $stuff's againChoices to it + (dm: _question, (trimmed: digit, $stuff's againChoices's _question)))
               (set: $stuff's againChoices's _question to it + (str:$stuff's number))
          ]
          <!--delete-->
          (if: _question contains _deleteWhich)[(move: $stuff's againChoices's _question into _trash)]
     ]<!--end loop-->
     
     <!--update-->
     (set: $stuff's againChoices to $stuff's againChoices)
}]]))

(set: _talkHooks to (dm:
     "againLibrary", "_againLibrary",
     "againIngredients", "_againIngredients",
     "againFuel", "_againFuel",
))

<!--create hooks-->
(for: each _round, ...(range: 1, (datanames: $stuff's againChoices)'s length - 1) )[
     (for: each _talkChoice, ...(datanames: _talkHooks))[{
          (hidden:)+(hook: _talkChoice + (str:_round))[
          <!--perform edit-->
          (_editChoices: _talkChoice)
          <!--display text-->
          (print: _talkHooks's _talkChoice)
          ]<!--end hook-->
     }]
]


<!--_againLibrary-->
(set: _againLibrary to [{
["Then you'd want to go one floor up from the lab. That's where our library is. You can find basic formulas there, some textbooks for the junior apprentices too. (either: "No borrowing though. We don't have the personnel to chase you down. So... don't make us, haha.", "You won't find the latest journals in there though, not until we can start paying for subscriptions again.", "Nothing a graduate student like you hasn't come across, but they're there.", "Just be careful with them. They're old. Like, Second-Colony old.")"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She thinks about it for a second before adding, ["There's also the Grand Exchange, if you're willing to pay... and willingly to sift through the drivel they sell."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's againChoices)
<br>
}])<!--end of _againLibrary-->

<!--_againIngredients-->
(set: _againIngredients to [{
["Same place as anyone does: The Grand Exchange downtown. (either: "Sorry, but what little we have left is for the children. Classes won't stop just because the principal and most of our faculties are gone.", "The markup can be high, but if you're just making something simple - which is what the student lab can manage anyhow - then a handful of roots and powder won't be too expensive.", "We ought to be more generous to visitors, but right now, even our associate staff have to pay for classroom materials out of pocket.")"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Can you show me how to get to the Grand Exchange?\"", "toGrandExchange",
     "<!--B-->\"Bring-your-own-ingredients. Got it.\"", "BYOI",
))
<br>

<!--toGrandExchange-->
[
["Uh, sure, so you see those domes over there? So from here, you head down the hill, then when you see the big road, the one with the red obelisks, you take a right... Erm, or was it left?..."]<VehVehLine| she mutters to herself several conflicting directions, then gives up. ["This is embarrassing. I usually just zone out whenever I make my groceries run. You might need a professional guide. Or you can just take a stroll, or several, around town, you'll eventually end up there. Apesai's a beautiful city. Confusing, but beautiful."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--B-->\"It's alright. I'll figure it out.\"", "BYOI",
))
<br>
](toGrandExchange|

<!--BYOI-->
[
["Yeah, sorry that I couldn't help out more. So, anything lab-related you want to ask me?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
(show: ?againIngredientsDone)
](BYOI|

[
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's againChoices)
<br>
](againIngredientsDone|

}])<!--end of _againIngredients-->


<!--againFuel-->
(set: _againFuel to [{
["You mean loose vehzin? You can try visiting the supplies warehouses or magic shops down in the Grand Exchange, but retail prices can sometimes get unreasonable. The further you get away from the highland mines, the more expensive vehzin gets. And Apesai is pretty far south."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
The most common form of vehzin found in Apesai is a monolith packed for bulk export, worth a merchant's lifesaving, and quite unusable.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Then where do you get //your// vehzin?\"", "getYourVehzin",
     "<!--B-->\"I'm sure there are more affordable sources of fuel.\"", "vehzinAlt",
))
<br>

<!--getYourVehzin-->
[
["I grit my teeth and pay retail prices, of course. Once things get back to normal, the school will reimburse me. Hopefully. It's research expenditure after all."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Something tells you she has less hope than she lets on, and a good magus rarely relies on hope alone.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"That's a shame.\"", "againFuelDone",
     "<!--B-->\"I'm sure there are more affordable sources of fuel.\"", "vehzinAlt",
))
<br>
](getYourVehzin|

<!--vehzinAlt-->
[
["Other than buying it straight from the highland clans in Barroz, anything else I can tell you will earn both of us an invitation to the governor's court - and not for employment either, haha,""]<VehVehLine| she laughs, then grimaces. ["It's probably more lax where you're from, but here in Askava, the only thing more controlled than vehzin is farabek. Without the fuel trade, I don't think Askava would even //be// a dahak."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"Got it.\"", "againFuelDone",
))
<br>
](vehzinAlt|

<!--againFuelDone-->
[
["I'm surprised you didn't bring your own, being a journeyman and everything,"]<VehVehLine| she then immediately covers her mouth. ["That was rude of me. Just ignore it, please."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's againChoices)
<br>
](againFuelDone|

}])<!--end of _againFuel-->


[
["Yeah, no problem! I hope the lab suits your needs. What am I saying? Of course it doesn't... You get what I mean, right? Anyway, is there something else?"]<VehVehLine|
<!--reset $stuff-->
(set: $stuff to (dm:))
(show: ?done)
<br>


](againThanks|

]<!--end of already have access-->


<!--done-->
